    {
      "tag": "70+",
      "h2": "French Maths",
      "body_html": "<p><strong>70 = soixante-dix</strong> (60+10). <strong>80 = quatre-vingts</strong> (4 x 20!). <strong>90 = quatre-vingt-dix</strong> (4 x 20 + 10). French does maths inside its numbers.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Age",
      "h2": "Saying Age",
      "body_html": "<p>'I am 13' = <strong>J'ai treize ans</strong>. Notice you use 'j'ai' (I have) — French says 'I have 13 years', not 'I am 13'.</p>"
    }
